#: cb731f613582436f8d41d009d4bd2320
msgid "模型顶层结构"
msgstr "Top-level Model Structure"

#: 874a77bb84c2451b8826eb4923328e14
msgid "核心的 PyTorch Lightning 模型，用于封装和训练 GNN。"
msgstr "The core PyTorch Lightning model for encapsulating and training the GNN."

#: cac99c15785046fca142037f268618bf
msgid ""
"这个类集成了表示网络和输出网络，并定义了完整的训练、验证和测试循环。 "
"它通过配置文件接收损失函数、评估指标和优化器参数，实现了高度的灵活性和可配置性。"
msgstr ""
"This class integrates the representation network and the output network, and "
"defines the complete training, validation, and test loops. It receives loss "
"functions, evaluation metrics, and optimizer parameters through a "
"configuration file, achieving a high degree of flexibility and "
"configurability."

#: 59fee320dca048bfab37de096b068775
msgid "图表示网络，用于从输入图数据中提取特征。"
msgstr "The graph representation network used to extract features from input graph data."

#: 267da4addcb249ba8af0b37fcc2ee104 2d44ea3761444cdbaf144ce5ed68cb8f
#: 632525faaf5d4e3a9e1e1ecfafec6e97 75c430946d6d4c80b5dd06df2102fbe3
#: fe3385115b794246a91f66f8cd5ebd53
msgid "type"
msgstr "type"

#: 731793f94f0f431c870f76c73b5bdd69 73629f8f1e7440fe8607bbba73b824e2
msgid "nn.Module"
msgstr "nn.Module"

#: c6381ff1ecd340e8a6632f55d7a95e82
msgid "输出网络，用于从表示网络提取的特征中预测目标属性。"
msgstr ""
"The output network used to predict target attributes from features extracted by "
"the representation network."

#: d98f979bd7ab40569c3c40e74af8f07e
msgid "一个字典列表，定义了用于训练的损失函数。"
msgstr "A list of dictionaries defining the loss functions for training."

#: 085cda7d14434f67be974827b0fba4cb 6684d748a16146a59583ff9f6ab87f51
msgid "List[Dict]"
msgstr "List[Dict]"

#: c34886b507144dca92e703e0951cbfb9
msgid "一个字典列表，定义了用于验证和测试的评估指标。"
msgstr "A list of dictionaries defining the evaluation metrics for validation and testing."

#: 3c0f273dc0c64878bc752e5e03fecb8e
msgid "一个可选的后处理函数，用于在测试阶段计算需要梯度信息的物理量。"
msgstr ""
"An optional post-processing function to compute physical quantities requiring "
"gradient information during the test phase."

#: 4a0f6dc457c7449c83e41d0e21a5cb7b
msgid "callable, optional"
msgstr "callable, optional"

#: 0fd5f4a7675a4b5ba2cfbd5a57ed0689
msgid "根据 `self.losses` 配置计算总损失。"
msgstr "Calculates the total loss based on the `self.losses` configuration."

#: 0d21a3e561c5489ebf1b35b8aedb9d8d 341998d651384aa6a57e1d515d9fc96e
#: 6100326b86d0418180cb61791b85f122 7fd951b11b5b4e058438dbf8004ff963
#: 851d7c753ace460f8e44a42da7ef0aeb 95388af9da6e42818a2ac35d5de09856
#: c6daf25e7b944d718dcfbd8ee291bde1 ffb135a234c94462a50d47b5bb8a8297
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: 5f5fa4bae65b497e8dd0fc291b15921c 8eee7b540e5a40b080a32c0b5ddcae0f
msgid "当前批次的数据，包含目标值。"
msgstr "The current batch of data, containing target values."

#: ba2ceba1072a4c3b8bb53b2cdc3d9650 c656a8e6fcf74ea898bbba4a1fad671a
msgid "模型的预测输出。"
msgstr "The model's prediction output."

#: b98d694c8ae04a9db8836149d0557a11
msgid "当前阶段的名称（'training', 'validation', or 'test'），用于日志记录。"
msgstr ""
"The name of the current stage ('training', 'validation', or 'test'), used for "
"logging."

#: 0f34cb030a404199a185a5c790551bed 10a6a2e317ff4f3aa9ed273d6f97defb
#: 39812c1c49bf4b2aa6c48a5ddbe3419d a3da31311d9f47628108f271e09667bc
#: b1f0a5b418b74058a0960e8a98e9c2c3 fd2790da74c84503b6a7fe8274f09a40
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: 02f1129b12674fbdb6c22022d170f301
msgid "计算得到的加权总损失。"
msgstr "The calculated weighted total loss."

#: 2a5aef44c1054cd799827c148f313372 64ba3cd81d9349229486c86ecd38c5cd
#: 73102041cade4245b7562d22fa3a94f9 97a3761fdf904ddd8fe059a0a1f86323
#: d57e90ea71e0439c9e8c55dc3f91e6aa e8776636a0414905a65364be51fe1e7a
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"

#: c89cfd31f5984a0db8974fdba7b84ce5
msgid "执行单个训练步骤。"
msgstr "Performs a single training step."

#: 53950ec88d2b4ec8be2e5d3bde3781f4
msgid "当前批次的训练数据。"
msgstr "The current batch of training data."

#: 20c9a7d1eb2b4140becd7dc0956c5333 24899a013f99442e83d041f53c024381
#: 335913bca1164e39a1bf2fe70c5083e4
msgid "当前批次的索引。"
msgstr "The index of the current batch."

#: b706cd88eca643fc8957328a12291b84
msgid "该批次的总训练损失。"
msgstr "The total training loss for this batch."

#: 8a3344b173cc42a3b6bbe6838c801412
msgid "执行单个验证步骤。"
msgstr "Performs a single validation step."

#: 76e0e8b2ef3e4ef7b48c5265bfc7c7cc
msgid "当前批次的验证数据。"
msgstr "The current batch of validation data."

#: 60a1efef74474cdaa4470b2b2c32a78b
msgid "包含该批次预测值和目标值的字典，用于 `validation_epoch_end`。"
msgstr ""
"A dictionary containing the predictions and targets for this batch, used in "
"`validation_epoch_end`."

#: fa34b98bd47948069ecb34957f1d483e
msgid "在验证的每个 epoch 结束时调用。"
msgstr "Called at the end of each validation epoch."

#: 7553e0b921804d63a634e407c8704b40
msgid "该方法聚合所有验证批次的预测和目标，并生成散点图以可视化模型性能。"
msgstr ""
"This method aggregates the predictions and targets from all validation batches "
"and generates scatter plots to visualize model performance."

#: fda59a0a864e4cc5ae90eb546045e21b
msgid "从 `validation_step` 返回的输出列表。"
msgstr "A list of outputs from `validation_step`."

#: 40f3d23cc2ea4c60ae2e0cc42ddd7a41
msgid "执行单个测试步骤。"
msgstr "Performs a single test step."

#: 445e7302842947ceab3948e7ef2cbeba
msgid "当前批次的测试数据。"
msgstr "The current batch of test data."

#: 31e4a9a59a8f4413b51dd815df0c664e
msgid "包含预测、目标和任何后处理值的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing predictions, targets, and any post-processing values."

#: e06ccb72dab342beab6fc25474b05ef7
msgid "在测试的每个 epoch 结束时调用。"
msgstr "Called at the end of each test epoch."

#: 40405c52bd6a4c7bab6df18a76e27d99
msgid "该方法聚合所有测试批次的结果，将预测和目标保存到 .npy 文件，并生成最终的散点图。"
msgstr ""
"This method aggregates the results from all test batches, saves the "
"predictions and targets to .npy files, and generates final scatter plots."

#: c0719081e6d64a3a9d62becddece0a5d
msgid "从 `test_step` 返回的输出列表。"
msgstr "A list of outputs from `test_step`."

#: cfe8b20fa0a84e0f815aa62f1385e421
msgid "定义模型的前向传播逻辑。"
msgstr "Defines the forward pass logic of the model."

#: 9b5dc6404d4b4af686a9716fca2ab97c
msgid "输入的批次数据。"
msgstr "The input batch of data."

#: 31ef573723cc4c0e9dd5dd189bc4685c
msgid "包含预测值的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the prediction values."

#: 3d0024bbd78a475895cc5f8369168d52
msgid "根据 `self.metrics` 配置计算并记录所有评估指标。"
msgstr ""
"Calculates and logs all evaluation metrics based on the `self.metrics` "
"configuration."

#: be14be7227ca486687e06ae9f66cef78
msgid "当前阶段的名称（'validation' or 'test'）。"
msgstr "The name of the current stage ('validation' or 'test')."

#: f088311dc35d49aebe374315a12eca32
msgid "配置模型的优化器和学习率调度器。"
msgstr "Configures the model's optimizers and learning rate schedulers."

#: a8257d60bd5e49a39f6e4b79829babd7
msgid "包含优化器列表和调度器配置列表的元组。"
msgstr ""
"A tuple containing a list of optimizers and a list of scheduler "
"configurations."

#: 54ec4ed3d9aa443dbaa949042bae96c4
msgid "一个调试辅助函数，用于打印模型参数的名称和梯度信息。"
msgstr ""
"A debugging helper function to print the names and gradient information of "
"model parameters."